Scripted diff: /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/index-lifecycle-and-filters.json --apply --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/index-conversion-receipt.json

Formatting: git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style "{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}" HEAD -- src/index/base.cpp src/index/blockfilterindex.cpp src/test/logging_event_tests.cpp

Convert all 24 direct legacy calls in index/base.cpp and blockfilterindex.cpp. Preserve Info warning prose, Error severity, exact readable diagnostics, synchronization and all existing failure returns. Copy raw hashes and unchanged ASCII DB prefixes; retain signed heights/file numbers. Support adjustments append six registry semantics and include the copied byte adapter. FatalErrorf forwarding helpers remain outside this direct-call batch.

Manual focused tests: native actual BlockFilterIndex invalid signed ranges and unchanged empty output, JSON levels/types/text; functional wallet-less real tx/filter indexing, mining, verification and persistence restart before typed startup assertions. Existing native adapter test covers byte lifetime and JSON escaping. AST 17 cases, inventory fixture, event lint 379 sites/13 contracts and Ruff 0.15.8 pass. Native build/runtime gate pending, no broad tests or benchmarks.
